      "line": 15,
      "purpose": "Just a few of them, so a long list doesn't all come down.",
      "note": "Today:  Runs, on a place in memory.\n\nA (built, recommended):  `the first 20 recipes where its title includes the search`  --  the same words as `the first recipe`, plus a number.\n\nB:  `20 recipes where its title includes the search`  --  shorter, but which 20?\n\nC:  `the top 20 recipes where its title includes the search`  --  everyday, but top by what?  `mejores` makes it worse.\n\nWhy:  Says which 20.\n\nRenaming it later:  3 lines in 3 files of rules, tests and docs, none in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
      "current": "the first 20 recipes where its title includes the search",
