      "line": 20,
      "purpose": "A count, without fetching the things themselves.",
      "note": "Today:  Runs, on a place in memory.\n\nA (built, recommended):  `the number of recipes where its title includes the search`  --  Spell's word already:  `the number of its ingredients`.\n\nB:  `how many recipes where its title includes the search`  --  the spoken form, and reads as a question.\n\nC:  `the count of recipes where its title includes the search`  --  a programmer's word, and `la cuenta` is also the bill.\n\nWhy:  Reuses a word Spell has.\n\nRenaming it later:  58 lines in 29 files of rules, tests and docs, 16 lines in the built-in projects, none in your own projects.",
      "current": "the number of recipes where its title includes the search",
